        type: "positive",
        headline: `AGELESS: ${s2.age}-Year-Old ${name} Refuses To Read The Calendar`,
        body: `${season2.goals} goals at ${s2.age}. Nutritionists want the meal plan, scientists want the bloodwork, defenders want it to stop. "I will retire when it stops being fun," ${name} smiled, ominously, at everyone under 30.`
